OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a few showers spreading
OL,7,Feast for a time. Then this afternoon
OL,8,Fwill be dry with some bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSome light and patchy rain
OL,12,Fwill spread east early this evening.
OL,13,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,14,Fcloudy with some showery rain, but
OL,15,Ffewer showers in the south.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAfter a mainly dry start rain
OL,18,Fwill spread southeast, lingering
OL,19,Facross the south into the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
